The original NoFrills module/config/event runtime is not bundled.
See docs/GUI_PORT.md and docs/M1.md for source paths and behavior differences.

Command adaptations retain typed persistence, device separation, focus guards,
conservative context filters, live aliases and cycle/length checks.

owo-lib (MIT), Mod Menu (MIT), Fabric and Fabric Language Kotlin are separate
external runtime dependencies, not bundled into this mod JAR. YACL is no
longer a solyanka dependency as of 0.2.1.
Gradle wrapper bootstrap files originate from FabricMC/fabric-example-mod (CC0).
Remaining requested upstream gameplay/render implementations and artwork are
not included yet; see the feature matrix for the exact implemented subset.

